@startuml
title DMS - Use Case Laporan Kinerja

left to right direction

actor "Penanggung Jawab Kinerja" as PJK

rectangle "Laporan Kinerja Metadata" {
  usecase "Lihat Dashboard Kinerja" as UCDashboard
  usecase "Lihat Laporan Kinerja" as UCLaporan
  usecase "Lihat Detail Fungsi / Kegiatan" as UCDetail
  usecase "Lihat Metadata Dokumen Final" as UCMetadata
}

PJK --> UCDashboard
PJK --> UCLaporan
PJK --> UCDetail
PJK --> UCMetadata

note bottom
  Laporan Kinerja hanya metadata.
  Tidak ada akses file, lampiran, preview, atau download.
  Fokus pada metrik dokumen, nominal, dan status.
end note

@enduml
